WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.603
[intense music]

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.206
The bee pupa are
stored at the bottom.

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:09.409
So to collect them, I have
to cut through the hive.

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.679
[buzzing]

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:22.122
They just pierced that comb,
and honey is just dripping out.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.491
I catch it with my
bamboo container.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:28.895
I'm just trying to get as
much of that honey as I can.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.702
My final job, to
reach even higher

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:37.737
and scrape the
honeycomb from the rock.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:41.941
Oh, my god.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:44.878
I'm just covered
in honey and bees,

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:46.846
and I'm sticky everywhere.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:56.589
I think we've gotten
all that we can get.

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:57.390
OK.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:04.330
That's getting the
honey the hard way.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:06.933
Woo!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.536
My hands just ache
from being stung.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:13.440
But this whole thing
is just solid honey.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:18.611
And this, the bottom part of
the comb is wax and pupae.

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.346
None of this stuff is
going to go to waste.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:28.188
We have a taste of our prize.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.056
I am just a sticky mess, but--

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:32.192
[non-english speech]

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:45.271
The sweetness of this
honey is, like, peach flavor.

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:49.042
Like, I never had
honey like this at all.

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:50.643
Mmm.

